{{Navbar-Global Gas Infrastructure Tracker}}
'''Dominion Gas Pipeline''' is an operating natural gas pipeline.<ref name=source1>[http://bit.ly/2kQofCO Dominion Gas Pipeline,] Wikipedia, accessed September 2017</ref>

==Location==
The pipeline runs from the Dominion Cove Point LNG Export Terminal in Lusby, Maryland, to Ohio, Virginia, and gas storage fields in Pennsylvania, and also into New England.<ref name=source1/><ref>{{Cite web|url=http://abarrelfull.wikidot.com/dominion-transmission-gas-pipeline|title=Dominion Transmission Gas Pipeline - A Barrel Full|website=abarrelfull.wikidot.com|language=en|access-date=2023-08-11}}</ref>

